0,1,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that keeps the door open for newcomers without exposing everyone's private costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Before we pick a model, we must consider the administrative burden on the person collecting the money.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It feels unfair that the same few people do all the work while others barely show up.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The hesitation in the room is real. People are overthinking whether they belong here anymore.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to guess the numbers again. We need to know exactly what we can count on.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if the collection process is too heavy, the whole thing collapses.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, exactly. I want to see the logs from the last treasurer to understand the load.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, is the hesitation about the cost or the social pressure?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, it is both. The cost makes the social pressure feel like a transaction.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I will look at the bank statements. I need to see who is actually paying on time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the taster forms. I need to know why people stop before joining.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I will review the treasurer's hours. If it takes six hours a month, we need a simpler system.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will tally the sign-in sheets. I want to see the actual distribution of attendance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the winter social feedback. I need to hear the quiet voices directly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will also check the ledger. I need to see the fixed costs that don't change.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's see what the data says before we argue about feelings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. Logic first, then we can talk about the structure.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The numbers will tell us who is carrying the weight.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,And the feedback will tell us if we are losing the soul of the club.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I am done guessing. Let's get the facts.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
